  "description": "Secret-vault abstractions for Compendium Framework: the ISecretVault facade with container and immutable-version ports, a provider-neutral connection/credential model, and declarative per-adapter capabilities. Versions are addressed by explicit revision (never \"latest\"), which is what makes value history and rollback stable across providers. Provider-agnostic ports for Scaleway Secret Manager, HashiCorp Vault, cloud key vaults, and in-house stores.",
